// The grammar of the core format, as productions.
include = [
  "./lexical.heron",
  "./structure.heron",
  "./prose.heron",
  "./code.heron",
  "./strings.heron",
  "./recovery.heron",
  "./productions.heron",
]

@lens(user, developer)
| The grammar of the core format: how a line says what it is, the modes a file is read in, the productions of the tree the parser builds, and how it recovers from errors.

forgiving_syntax: goal(measure = "A file with one mistake still checks everywhere else.") {{
  Authors see every problem in a file at once, because a mistake never stops the rest of the file from being read.
}}
